00:18:47.000 --> 00:18:49.000
I'm reading the Quran as you see.

00:18:49.000 --> 00:18:51.000
Dr. Khalifa: I'm only reading the Quran.

00:18:51.000 --> 00:18:58.000
A man: (unintelligible)

