00:21:04.000 --> 00:21:11.000
The believers, the believers are described in Quran as loving Allah Subhanahu Wa Ta'ala most of all.

00:21:16.000 --> 00:21:17.000
That they are described as,

00:21:17.000 --> 00:21:19.000
(2:165) أَشَدُّ حُبًّۭا لِّلَّهِ

00:21:20.000 --> 00:21:22.000
Their greatest love is for Allah Subhanahu Wa Ta'ala.

00:21:22.000 --> 00:21:32.000
And this is to put myself on trial and find out if I am an idol worshipper or not, that I may be an idol worshipper who is unaware,

00:21:32.000 --> 00:21:38.000
I have to check my heart and see how I respond to Allah and somebody else.

00:21:38.000 --> 00:21:48.000
And unfortunately in many Muslim gatherings, you say the word "Allah", and then silence, but then you say the word Muhammad,

00:21:48.000 --> 00:21:51.000
